WEBVTT

NOTE Brightloom Retail — quarterly check-in

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Dana Whitfield>How has the rollout been across the new stores?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Samira Haddad>Fine. The stores are up, staff picked it up quickly, no complaints from the floor.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Dana Whitfield>A lot of retailers tell me stock counts are painful at that size. Is that true for you?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Samira Haddad>Not really. We count weekly and it has never been a drama. The team is used to it.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Dana Whitfield>Good. I'll send the usage summary over and we can talk again after the season.
